    "description": "Assorted Writing Instrument Collection\nThis collection features a variety of vintage and pre-owned writing instruments from notable brands including Cross, Sheaffer, Parker, and Bill Blass. The assortment includes fountain pens, ballpoint pens, and mechanical pencils, with several items housed in their original presentation boxes or packaging.\nCross mechanical pencil in original blister packaging, Reorder No. 2202CSOD, Made in USA.\nSheaffer fountain pen with silver-tone finish.\nParker fountain pen and refill set in original box, marked Biolab.\nBill Blass pen set in original presentation box.\nAssorted loose pens including a yellow Nautica branded pen, a blue pen, and various black and silver-tone writing instruments.\nIncludes a leather-style pen sleeve marked Cross.\nItems are pre-owned and show varying degrees of wear, including surface scratches and finish loss on some barrels.\nCondition:\nThese are pre-owned writing instruments in various states of condition. Some pens show signs of use, including finish wear on the yellow barrel and ink residue on nibs. Yellow barreled pen has an ink leak internally that will need cleaned out for best performance, currently gets stuck with the pen tip out. The set is sold as-is, current functionality is not guaranteed for any included ink refills/cartridges. Please see photos for details.",
